WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
Two new roots this week, and both are about feeling.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.860
One leans toward emotion.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.140
One leans toward the senses.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.330
Then listen to long words.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:14.180
When a word grows, its strongest beat can move.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:19.800
In the council fire game, say each word out loud and tap the beat you say the strongest.
